Platform) project, along with their licenses. Dependencies are grouped by
ecosystem (Python, Node.js/TypeScript, Container Images, Infrastructure Tools).

This inventory was generated on 2026-05-01 from the project's dependency
manifests (pyproject.toml, requirements.txt, package.json, Dockerfiles).

NOTE: This file covers direct dependencies only. 

